{
 "scope": "The SECOND sub-block of the codimension-m regular coarea case: the PARAMETRIC IMPLICIT FUNCTION CHARTING. Near a regular point the whole family of fibres of u is simultaneously the graph of one globally C1 map, with the level as a parameter. NO COAREA FORMULA IS PROVED. No hole migrated. The log-concave Cheeger-Buser line belongs to collaborator Wang Haocheng and was not touched.",
